('A transaction modifies a single aggregate.', 'A common DDD guideline is to modify one aggregate per transaction; consciously chosen exceptions exist, and required invariants still need a correct atomic protocol.'),
('```python\nclass Order:\n    MAX = 50', '```python\nclass OrderLocked(Exception): pass\nclass TooManyLines(Exception): pass\nclass EmptyOrder(Exception): pass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass OrderLine:\n    sku: str\n    qty: int\n    price: Money\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass OrderPlaced:\n    order_id: int\n\nclass Order:\n    MAX = 50'),
