('After the order is committed, a handler reserves stock in its own transaction.', 'Commit the state and a durable pending event atomically (for example an outbox); a reliable relay invokes an idempotent reservation handler in a separate transaction.'),
('Conway\'s law means the contexts and team boundaries tend to converge whether you plan it or not.', 'communication structure can influence boundaries; Conway\'s observation is not a deterministic rule that contexts must match teams.'),
